1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,652
Reach your hands out,

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:06,913
cut through the wind,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,130
and forge ahead, drawing your own map as you go!

4
00:00:16,478 --> 00:00:19,565
We can't even tell left from right

5
00:00:19,608 --> 00:00:22,782
in this tempest-tossed era

6
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,043
Even the values we've honed

7
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:29,390
seem ready to crumble

8
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:32,652
Is the compass leading us true,

9
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,869
or is it leading us astray?

10
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:39,217
Nobody knows for sure!

11
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:45,652
Just breathe deep, close your eyes

12
00:00:45,739 --> 00:00:52,696
and you'll find your soul guiding the way!

13
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,913
Reach your hands out,

14
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:59,174
cut through the wind,

15
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:04,043
and kick away the darkness!

16
00:01:05,086 --> 00:01:08,129
I'm doing this for myself,

17
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:12,260
and you're doing this for yourself too, right?

18
00:01:12,347 --> 00:01:17,347
Forge ahead, painting the world in your own colors!

19
00:01:24,086 --> 00:01:25,173
Hey!

20
00:01:25,174 --> 00:01:27,608
What the heck're ya doin', Momo?!
Get flyin'!

21
00:01:29,478 --> 00:01:32,347
No... I... I know!

22
00:01:32,347 --> 00:01:34,260
B-But...

23
00:01:38,565 --> 00:01:40,956
M-My body will not move!

24
00:01:42,869 --> 00:01:45,739
D-Do you realize how high up I would be...

25
00:01:45,739 --> 00:01:48,696
were I to so much as raise my head?!

26
00:01:48,739 --> 00:01:50,435
Who cares, dummy?!

27
00:01:50,435 --> 00:01:53,695
You're a grown man and
still scared o' heights?!

28
00:01:53,696 --> 00:01:56,521
Silence!
I will not tolerate insolence!

29
00:01:56,521 --> 00:01:58,695
Th-There is naught we samurai fear!

30
00:01:59,869 --> 00:02:02,565
Then get flyin'!
Fly, dammit!

31
00:02:02,565 --> 00:02:05,260
I cannot, not right this moment!
Later, perhaps...

32
00:02:05,260 --> 00:02:08,086
The hell'd ya grow up for, then?!

33
00:02:08,086 --> 00:02:09,956
You're a dragon!
Fly!

34
00:02:09,957 --> 00:02:12,565
I know that!
Do not hurry me!

35
00:02:12,565 --> 00:02:14,130
We're in a hurry, though!

36
00:02:14,130 --> 00:02:17,521
If we let Kaido run wild around Onigashima,
everyone's gonna be toast!

37
00:02:18,130 --> 00:02:19,304
I understand that!

38
00:02:19,957 --> 00:02:22,260
Alas, my heart is not prepared...

39
00:02:22,260 --> 00:02:24,608
Quit givin' me excuses....

40
00:02:25,130 --> 00:02:26,826
...and fly!

41
00:02:26,826 --> 00:02:28,173
Owowowowowow!

42
00:02:28,174 --> 00:02:30,869
W-Wait, would you?!

43
00:02:30,869 --> 00:02:32,086
Shaddap!

44
00:02:32,478 --> 00:02:35,782
You and me're puttin'
Kaido down, together!

45
00:02:53,739 --> 00:02:55,174
Mirror Mountain.

46
00:03:03,739 --> 00:03:05,174
Defended yourself, huh...

47
00:03:06,913 --> 00:03:08,522
I cannot fall, not yet!

48
00:03:11,217 --> 00:03:13,130
Not until Luffy returns!

49
00:03:17,869 --> 00:03:20,521
All I need do is to
survive until that moment!

50
00:03:31,086 --> 00:03:32,825
Hallowed Glacier Slash!

51
00:03:53,086 --> 00:03:55,651
Look at you...

52
00:03:56,957 --> 00:04:02,478
Challenging me,
like you were one of Wano's own people...

53
00:04:07,521 --> 00:04:09,304
Yamato!

54
00:04:09,304 --> 00:04:11,825
You're an ogre's child!

55
00:04:14,913 --> 00:04:19,522
But you are still the son of Kaido!
You can't run...

56
00:04:20,174 --> 00:04:22,478
...from what's in your blood!

57
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:26,913
Stop!

58
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:30,435
No matter what or who
you choose to fight for,

59
00:04:31,086 --> 00:04:35,999
not a single samurai here...

60
00:04:38,347 --> 00:04:41,912
...sees you as one of their own!

61
00:04:46,086 --> 00:04:47,477
Silence!

62
00:04:47,478 --> 00:04:49,261
That has nothing to do...

63
00:04:51,260 --> 00:04:53,521
with how I feel!

64
00:05:15,782 --> 00:05:19,782
You've been living
on this island all alone.

65
00:05:19,782 --> 00:05:23,217
Running around the island,
crawling inside ceilings.

66
00:05:23,565 --> 00:05:26,173
You've been alone your whole life!

67
00:05:33,391 --> 00:05:34,956
But I do...

68
00:05:36,260 --> 00:05:36,999
...have friends!

69
00:05:38,043 --> 00:05:39,956
I have a precious friend!

70
00:05:40,347 --> 00:05:41,217
No...

71
00:05:42,696 --> 00:05:43,652
I had!

72
00:05:56,347 --> 00:06:00,869
So you did.
Like those samurai back then...

73
00:06:04,435 --> 00:06:08,391
Anyone that was ever
nice to you is dead!

74
00:06:35,304 --> 00:06:37,956
No wonder 'tis so cold.
It is snowing...

75
00:06:40,826 --> 00:06:43,086
I am so hungry...

76
00:06:44,869 --> 00:06:47,173
How hungry I am...

77
00:07:15,435 --> 00:07:17,695
There you are, Ogre Princess.

78
00:07:21,652 --> 00:07:24,130
Please wait, Ogre Princess.

79
00:07:24,130 --> 00:07:26,391
You must be hungry.

80
00:07:28,347 --> 00:07:29,347
Here, take it.

81
00:07:41,739 --> 00:07:43,130
Before someone sees, now!

82
00:07:43,130 --> 00:07:44,826
Dig in!

83
00:07:47,043 --> 00:07:48,260
Thank you!

84
00:07:51,260 --> 00:07:52,521
I appreciate it!

85
00:08:00,521 --> 00:08:01,565
Yum...!

86
00:08:02,478 --> 00:08:03,565
So delicious...

87
00:08:03,565 --> 00:08:07,260
Thank you... Thank you...

88
00:08:08,826 --> 00:08:11,347
Good for you, Ogre Princess.

89
00:08:19,435 --> 00:08:23,130
Hey, so why'd he get the axe
all of a sudden?

90
00:08:23,130 --> 00:08:28,391
Heard he was slipping food
to the Ogre Princess.

91
00:08:29,696 --> 00:08:33,478
Even got her a blanket,
thinking she was freezing!

92
00:08:33,478 --> 00:08:36,478
Awww, awful nice of 'im!

93
00:08:36,478 --> 00:08:41,000
The Ogre Princess is still on the run, isn't she?
Saying she wants to become Oden...

94
00:08:43,739 --> 00:08:46,608
They did not simply die.
You murdered them!

95
00:08:46,608 --> 00:08:49,825
They got in the way of me
educating my child.

96
00:08:49,869 --> 00:08:51,304
They deserved it!

97
00:08:52,652 --> 00:08:54,913
You should know better by now...

98
00:08:55,913 --> 00:08:58,261
...Yamato!

99
00:09:22,435 --> 00:09:25,435
You have no friends!

100
00:09:27,347 --> 00:09:32,782
Even if you think those
Wano people're on your side,

101
00:09:32,782 --> 00:09:35,043
that's just on the surface!

102
00:09:36,435 --> 00:09:38,652
They're all afraid of you!

103
00:09:40,782 --> 00:09:43,217
You gotta rule people by force!

104
00:09:44,696 --> 00:09:46,739
And that's because
you're the kid of an ogre!

105
00:09:48,435 --> 00:09:52,087
You can't be friends with humans!

106
00:09:52,826 --> 00:09:55,652
And that's just life for you,

107
00:09:55,696 --> 00:09:58,696
Yamato!

108
00:10:08,304 --> 00:10:09,651
Attaboy, Momo!

109
00:10:15,521 --> 00:10:17,825
I am flying!

110
00:10:17,826 --> 00:10:20,130
Nice!
Keep it up, Momo!

111
00:10:23,565 --> 00:10:25,956
Fly us to Onigashima!

112
00:10:25,957 --> 00:10:27,826
Sally forth!

113
00:10:27,826 --> 00:10:29,652
Go!

114
00:10:29,652 --> 00:10:30,782
Momo!

115
00:10:30,869 --> 00:10:32,956
Goooo!

116
00:10:32,957 --> 00:10:35,043
Onward! Onward!

117
00:10:36,217 --> 00:10:38,956
Man, talk about fast!
Gotta be a dragon thing!

118
00:10:38,957 --> 00:10:41,435
Keep going and we'll
catch up in no time!

119
00:10:52,826 --> 00:10:55,130
We're off-course!
Left!

120
00:10:55,130 --> 00:10:56,826
Momo! More to the left!

121
00:10:56,826 --> 00:10:58,347
Left?!

122
00:10:58,347 --> 00:10:59,651
Ah...

123
00:10:59,739 --> 00:11:01,261
Like this?!

124
00:11:02,478 --> 00:11:04,130
That's it! Attaboy!

125
00:11:08,217 --> 00:11:09,826
All right! Onigashima...

126
00:11:10,304 --> 00:11:11,564
We've caught up!

127
00:11:14,478 --> 00:11:18,347
I see a shadow on the rooftop!
Think that's Kaido!

128
00:11:18,347 --> 00:11:19,608
To the rooftop!

129
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,478
Rooftop?

130
00:11:21,478 --> 00:11:23,478
Understood!

131
00:11:23,478 --> 00:11:27,043
No, no! Not up!
Down!

132
00:11:27,043 --> 00:11:28,695
Down?!

133
00:11:39,130 --> 00:11:41,826
Hey! No! No, no!

134
00:11:41,826 --> 00:11:44,999
Not that way!
Are your eyes even open?!

135
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:48,347
You buffoon!
How could I possibly fly with eyes open?!

136
00:11:48,347 --> 00:11:49,825
Whaaa?!

137
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:51,521
No!

138
00:11:53,696 --> 00:11:56,478
This ain't the rooftop!

139
00:12:02,869 --> 00:12:04,478
Three-Sword Style...

140
00:12:15,217 --> 00:12:16,608
What is that?!

141
00:12:16,608 --> 00:12:18,478
A dragon?!

142
00:12:18,478 --> 00:12:21,086
Huh?! Kaido-san?!

143
00:12:21,086 --> 00:12:22,477
No, that's not right!

144
00:12:25,739 --> 00:12:27,956
Huh?! Another dragon?!

145
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,608
Uh? Luffy!

146
00:12:31,608 --> 00:12:35,260
Hit the brakes!
Stop, stop!

147
00:12:35,260 --> 00:12:36,651
Luffy, m'boy!

148
00:12:37,435 --> 00:12:38,739
Luffy!

149
00:12:38,739 --> 00:12:40,696
A sight for sore eyes!

150
00:12:40,696 --> 00:12:43,522
Whoahuhwhaaaa?!

151
00:12:45,478 --> 00:12:48,521
Stop, Momo!
What the hellre ya doing?!

152
00:12:51,869 --> 00:12:55,043
A dragon?!
Kaido, that you?!

153
00:12:57,739 --> 00:12:58,739
Straw Hatter?!

154
00:12:59,174 --> 00:13:00,260
What the hell?!

155
00:13:00,260 --> 00:13:02,521
What's. Going. On?!

156
00:13:09,260 --> 00:13:11,390
Cut it out, dammit!

157
00:13:11,391 --> 00:13:13,435
Open your eyes, Momo!

158
00:13:13,435 --> 00:13:14,956
'Tis impossible!

159
00:13:14,957 --> 00:13:17,565
Besides, something got into them!

160
00:13:23,739 --> 00:13:26,217
That's all 'cause you crashed
into a buncha stuff!

161
00:13:26,217 --> 00:13:28,869
Do something, Luffy!

162
00:13:28,869 --> 00:13:31,521
Show me...

163
00:13:31,521 --> 00:13:34,434
Show me what yer made of
and look in front!

164
00:13:35,869 --> 00:13:38,260
That's a wall!
Braaaakes!

165
00:13:38,347 --> 00:13:41,999
Whaaaa!!

166
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:48,260
Castle Interior, Third Floor reporting in!
Right now, Kaido-san's on the rampage...

167
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:51,086
No! That's not him!

168
00:13:51,086 --> 00:13:54,216
Huh?!
But there can't be two dragons!

169
00:13:54,217 --> 00:13:55,913
The color's different, though!

170
00:13:56,000 --> 00:14:00,609
Find out who the pink dragon is!

171
00:14:09,260 --> 00:14:11,738
Pretty damn noisy down there...

172
00:14:12,782 --> 00:14:14,956
Linlin, maybe?

173
00:14:14,957 --> 00:14:17,478
Gonna have to rebuild the castle.

174
00:14:20,304 --> 00:14:22,521
cannot let things...

175
00:14:22,521 --> 00:14:23,999
...end like this!

176
00:14:39,608 --> 00:14:41,565
Divine... Swiftness!

177
00:14:42,826 --> 00:14:43,521
All right!

178
00:14:44,478 --> 00:14:45,391
There he is!

179
00:14:45,739 --> 00:14:47,130
On the rooftop!

180
00:14:47,782 --> 00:14:48,695
Are we there?!

181
00:14:48,696 --> 00:14:50,348
Ah, not good!

182
00:14:50,869 --> 00:14:55,173
We are mid-air!
I must return to solid ground!

183
00:14:55,521 --> 00:14:57,391
There's Kaido!

184
00:14:57,435 --> 00:14:59,435
Right down there,
make a dive for it!

185
00:14:59,435 --> 00:15:00,782
Kaido?!

186
00:15:06,521 --> 00:15:08,260
Gear 48

187
00:15:15,086 --> 00:15:16,956
Snakeman!

188
00:15:20,217 --> 00:15:23,782
Gum-Gum...

189
00:15:24,608 --> 00:15:25,782
Divine Swiftness!

190
00:15:28,739 --> 00:15:30,130
White Serpent!

191
00:15:39,260 --> 00:15:41,999
Jet Culverin!

192
00:16:41,174 --> 00:16:41,695
Eh?!

193
00:16:44,130 --> 00:16:45,347
Luffy!

194
00:16:45,347 --> 00:16:47,260
Oh, Yamabro!

195
00:16:48,435 --> 00:16:51,130
So you're the one that's been
holding off Kaido!

196
00:16:51,130 --> 00:16:53,739
Saved our butts!
Thanks!

197
00:16:53,739 --> 00:16:56,652
A sight for sore eyes!
I have been waiting!

198
00:16:57,174 --> 00:16:58,521
A pink dragon!

199
00:16:58,913 --> 00:16:59,913
It cannot be...!

200
00:17:19,174 --> 00:17:21,434
How in the hell did you live...

201
00:17:21,957 --> 00:17:23,391
Straw Hat?!

202
00:17:23,826 --> 00:17:25,739
How in the hell would I die?

203
00:17:28,043 --> 00:17:31,086
I'm the future Pirate King!

204
00:17:32,521 --> 00:17:35,043
And who the hell's that dragon
supposed to be?

205
00:17:35,521 --> 00:17:37,651
M-My...

206
00:17:41,260 --> 00:17:43,608
My name is...

207
00:17:44,913 --> 00:17:47,217
...Kozuki Momonosuke!

208
00:17:47,217 --> 00:17:50,608
The future Shogun of Wano!

209
00:18:10,086 --> 00:18:11,912
Enjoying yourself, O-Toko?

210
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:12,913
Uh-huh!

211
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,391
Where are you going, O-Tama?!

212
00:18:23,957 --> 00:18:28,391
Do you realize the danger
in what you are doing?!

213
00:18:29,696 --> 00:18:31,782
Forgive me, Master!

214
00:18:31,782 --> 00:18:34,608
I can't help it,
I gotta do somethin'!

215
00:18:34,608 --> 00:18:36,478
Don't worry!

216
00:18:36,478 --> 00:18:40,348
We'll protect her with our lives!

217
00:18:42,391 --> 00:18:45,695
O-Tama!

218
00:18:51,043 --> 00:18:53,303
O-Tama, are you faring well?

219
00:18:59,086 --> 00:19:02,912
Alas, she is a sea away...
And I have no way of knowing...

220
00:19:24,435 --> 00:19:26,869
Reporting in,
concerning a mysterious dragon!

221
00:19:27,782 --> 00:19:31,782
On the rooftop, Young Master Yamato
stands alone, bruised and bloodied...

222
00:19:33,652 --> 00:19:36,782
So Yamato was the one
holding off Kaido-san...!

223
00:19:39,565 --> 00:19:43,956
And in the skies,
something unbelievable is taking place...

224
00:19:46,304 --> 00:19:48,434
Two dragons, squaring off!

225
00:19:52,217 --> 00:19:55,391
Facing Kaido-sama,
the Azure Dragon...

226
00:19:56,043 --> 00:19:57,564
...is a pink dragon!

227
00:20:00,435 --> 00:20:02,348
And a pirate upon its back...

228
00:20:02,826 --> 00:20:04,521
Straw Hat Luffy!

229
00:20:09,260 --> 00:20:11,825
The pink dragon's identity
is unknown!

230
00:20:15,696 --> 00:20:18,913
But there is no doubt
it is an enemy of ours!

231
00:20:28,174 --> 00:20:29,347
Momonosuke-kun!

232
00:20:29,347 --> 00:20:31,869
Your form resembles...

233
00:20:33,217 --> 00:20:35,130
...my father!

234
00:20:35,130 --> 00:20:40,478
If I could become a monster such as he,
I would be of some help to everyone...

235
00:20:41,086 --> 00:20:42,347
Momonosuke-kun!

236
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:48,130
What a surprise!
You're that brat!

237
00:20:51,391 --> 00:20:52,608
But, you see...

238
00:20:53,565 --> 00:20:57,347
...the world ain't big enough
for two dragons!

239
00:21:07,130 --> 00:21:08,521
He is breathing fire!

240
00:21:08,608 --> 00:21:10,738
Amright
you breathe something too!

241
00:21:10,739 --> 00:21:13,043
Breathe what?!
I cannot possibly...!

242
00:21:13,043 --> 00:21:14,825
Momo, you can breathe it!

243
00:21:19,217 --> 00:21:22,565
Humans cannot
simply breathe fire!

244
00:21:22,608 --> 00:21:25,521
Blast Breath!

245
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:49,913
N-No! I am not here to fight!

246
00:21:49,913 --> 00:21:51,348
Hey, Momo!

247
00:21:53,304 --> 00:21:54,825
Whaaaaat?!

248
00:21:58,521 --> 00:21:59,912
Gear 3!

249
00:22:02,696 --> 00:22:06,391
Wait, Luffy! I cannot, I cannot!
'Tis impossible for me!

250
00:22:18,174 --> 00:22:20,043
Gum-Gum...

251
00:22:22,347 --> 00:22:26,043
...Elephant Gun!

252
00:22:32,739 --> 00:22:33,652
Hey, Momo!

253
00:22:34,608 --> 00:22:36,130
Take a bite outta Kaido!

254
00:22:38,043 --> 00:22:38,999
I cannot!

255
00:22:46,478 --> 00:22:48,435
Mother!

256
00:22:50,304 --> 00:22:54,260
All will be well!
I will ensure the two of you escape!

257
00:22:54,957 --> 00:22:56,261
There is a way out of this!

258
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,477
Mother!

259
00:23:54,478 --> 00:23:58,043
Your father was a fool of a lord.

260
00:23:58,043 --> 00:24:00,608
What is your name?!

261
00:24:00,608 --> 00:24:01,825
Tell me!

262
00:24:06,435 --> 00:24:07,348
Mo...

263
00:24:13,435 --> 00:24:15,391
Father!

264
00:24:15,652 --> 00:24:18,522
Kaido!

265
00:24:27,739 --> 00:24:31,391
What're you doing, brat?!

266
00:24:40,869 --> 00:24:44,565
You laid waste to my country!

267
00:24:45,608 --> 00:24:48,130
Were it not for you...

268
00:24:49,000 --> 00:24:50,261
Father would...

269
00:24:51,478 --> 00:24:52,913
Mother would...

270
00:24:57,086 --> 00:25:01,216
Thought I asked you
what the hell you're doing!

271
00:25:07,826 --> 00:25:09,999
Get away, Momonosuke-kun!

272
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:12,652
Blast Breath!

273
00:25:24,217 --> 00:25:25,826
That's it, Momo!

274
00:25:26,608 --> 00:25:28,565
What?! Momonosuke-sama?!

275
00:25:29,130 --> 00:25:32,826
Momonosuke-sama is a dragon?
A pink one?!

276
00:25:32,826 --> 00:25:34,956
Attaboy, Momonosuke-sama!

277
00:25:55,086 --> 00:25:57,825
That's Kaido you just bit!

278
00:26:08,957 --> 00:26:11,478
Dragons bring
with them thunderclouds...

279
00:26:13,652 --> 00:26:16,130
And there are two dragons here...

280
00:26:16,130 --> 00:26:19,782
That means no more moon tonight.

281
00:26:24,217 --> 00:26:29,391
One more hit from you and
I probably wouldn't be getting up ever again.

282
00:26:29,391 --> 00:26:35,086
The Sulong transformation is a double-edged sword,
feeding on your life force.

283
00:26:35,086 --> 00:26:38,129
It's the end for you, not me.

284
00:27:03,086 --> 00:27:04,608
He lost his Sulong form!

285
00:27:04,608 --> 00:27:06,521
Master Nekomamushi!

286
00:27:07,869 --> 00:27:10,739
