339
00:33:03,260 --> 00:33:04,999
...One-Sword Style:

340
00:33:17,608 --> 00:33:22,782
Feline...

341
00:33:32,696 --> 00:33:35,956
...Frenzy!

342
00:33:40,957 --> 00:33:45,348
Worthless pile of dog crap!

343
00:33:46,608 --> 00:33:47,521
Canine...

344
00:33:48,217 --> 00:33:51,043
...Cleaver!

345
00:34:30,521 --> 00:34:31,651
Pedro...

346
00:34:32,652 --> 00:34:36,652
Wish I could knock a few back
with you-gara while moon gazin'...

347
00:34:38,652 --> 00:34:40,435
Master Nekomamushi!

348
00:34:40,435 --> 00:34:42,391
Oh, Carrot!

349
00:34:43,435 --> 00:34:45,913
That was amazing, Master!

350
00:34:45,913 --> 00:34:47,043
Aye!

351
00:34:47,043 --> 00:34:49,695
You've finally done it, Master!

352
00:34:50,086 --> 00:34:53,216
Pedro... would be happy!

353
00:34:55,913 --> 00:34:57,130
All o' you-gara...

354
00:34:59,565 --> 00:35:02,782
Careful now,
or you'll turn Sulong.

355
00:35:03,086 --> 00:35:05,608
Haven't a damn clue why,

356
00:35:05,608 --> 00:35:08,478
...but the moon's
totally out now.

357
00:35:25,869 --> 00:35:28,695
Such is our rage,
all we of the Mink Tribe!

358
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:40,870
I can hardly believe it!
The Jack is...

359
00:35:41,782 --> 00:35:46,391
I did not expect one of
the All-Stars to be taken down!

360
00:35:48,957 --> 00:35:50,478
Ah, well...

361
00:35:50,478 --> 00:35:53,435
That does not matter to me!